@startuml Sum_Ssfm_SignalInfoProvider_PROPOSAL_SYNC_Handler
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
"SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_SignalStatusAv_LoC"

**Interfaces Legend**
    //ri40 //: Signal<n> 
    //pi41 //: Signal<n>_Av
    //pi42 //: Signal<n>_LcFA
    //pi43 //: Signal<n>_Inv
    //pi44 //: Signal<n>_FxI
    //pi45 //: Signal<n>_FxFA
    //FxI  //: Signal<n>_FxI_FromInternal
    //FxFA //: Signal<n>_FxFA_FromInternal
    //II_LcFA //: LostOfCom<n>_FA_FromInternal
    //II_Av//: Signal<n>_Av
    //II_inv//: Signal<n>_Inv_FromInternal
end legend

note left of P
The block handles all signal status values and provides them
to the requesting software components.
Triggering mechanism(s) for providing messages shall be discussed 
and further analyzed.
end note
component SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_SignalInfoProvider_Handler as P {
    portin ri40
    portout pi41
    portout pi42
    portout pi43
    portout pi44
    portout pi45

    [Sum_Ssfm_SignalInfoProvider_Handler] as SS
}

() FxI
() FxFA
() II_Av
() II_inv
() II_LcFA

ri40 --> SS

FxI -l-> SS
FxFA -l-> SS
II_Av -r-> SS
II_inv -r-> SS
II_LcFA -r-> SS

SS --> pi41
SS --> pi42
SS --> pi43
SS --> pi44
SS --> pi45



@enduml